{
  "name": "AI Lead Response Bot - Portfolio Template",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup checklist\n1. Add an HTTP Header Auth credential named \"OpenAI API Key\" (Header Name: Authorization, Value: Bearer YOUR_OPENAI_KEY) and attach it on the \"Draft AI Response\" node.\n2. Add an SMTP credential for sending email and attach it on both Email Send nodes.\n3. Replace YOUR_BUSINESS_EMAIL and YOUR_SALES_TEAM_EMAIL placeholders in the two Email Send nodes.\n4. Point your web form / lead-capture tool to this Webhook's Production URL, posting JSON like: { \"name\": \"...\", \"email\": \"...\", \"company\": \"...\", \"message\": \"...\" }.\n5. Test with the 'Execute workflow' button using sample data before activating.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "6dfd2b51-6894-4e22-98f7-a0c037015ad2",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
